{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670919932448639259","title":"自动驾驶测试开发工程师","description":"1.负责自动驾驶问题的分析，包括感知、预测、规划、控制等模块问题的分析和仿真场景库的构建;\n2. 根据自动驾驶车辆的运行设计域（ODD）设计Worldsim仿真测试用例，并在场景编辑软件中实现为具体测试场景用例；\n3. 采用Logsim方式建立自动驾驶仿真测试场景库，评价规则（Metrics），并对仿真测试结果进行监控和分析；\n4. 对仿真、路测问题进行问题分析和分类，跟进问题的闭环，输出仿真测试报告。","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，计算机、车辆、控制等相关专业；\n2. 了解自动驾驶功能、系统原理，有汽车行业或自动驾驶方向工作经验；\n3. 了解自动驾驶仿真测试工作模式，能够进行感知、规控等模块级的问题分析；\n4. 熟练使用Python、C/C++等常用编程语言，熟悉ROS、Linux、计算机原理等；\n5. 有机器学习、统计建模、数据分析实战经验者优先；\n6. 具备较强的自驱力、自学能力、沟通与表达能力，良好的团队协作意识。","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786025313767,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7467761529010634860","name":"测试类","en_name":"Testing","i18n_name":"测试类"},"job_id":"7670919932448459035","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北